{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs","id":734191,"title":"Hatewheel talks the 3e Solar sigs","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Solar Exalted"],"posts":[{"date":"2015-10-28T03:42:51-07:00","id":734191,"title":"Hatewheel talks the 3e Solar sigs","content":"Hatewheel's offering up excerpts from the 3e Solar sigs' bios, kicking off with <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/notes/john-m%C3%B8rke/a-look-at-exalteds-new-solars-prince-diamond/10153738008345909\" target=\"_blank\">Prince Diamond.</a>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":6}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/51-marin","name":"marin","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2019"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T03:46:09-07:00","id":734225,"title":"","content":"Wheee. Can't wait for Perfect Soul's bio.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;From now on, instead of saying 'half-assed', I will use 'muled'. 'This is a muled job, Chris', I will say to my friend Chris. 'You need to do better, or your ass is grass. And not, like, metaphorical grass. There are weeds growing in there as we speak.'<br /> <br /> &quot;'The DEA is after you, man' I will tell him, in all seriousness.&quot;","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8891-khantalas","name":"Khantalas","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8891_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"899"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T03:52:43-07:00","id":734241,"title":"","content":"I wonder if jiara is kind of the wig circles default place.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T05:21:52-07:00","id":734407,"title":"","content":"Telling my trans friends about Prince Diamond put big smiles on their faces. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T07:24:42-07:00","id":734654,"title":"","content":"... oh, god.<br /> <br /> Hearing the bits and pieces which writers occasionally dribbled out before the release, I tended to ignore Prince Diamond. His art was great, and I loved that there was a trans character in the Circle, but beyond that... Diamond just seemed the least interesting of them.<br /> <br /> And now, I learn that's because I totally overlooked the (other) core of his concept - he's the straight-up good guy. Without knowing it, I'd become one of those Grimdark 90s types who thinks that heroism is boring.<br /> <br /> NOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOOooooooooooooooooOOOOOOOOOOOOOOO OOOOOOOOOOOOoooooooooooooooOOOOOOOOOOOOO!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":12}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T07:47:30-07:00","id":734711,"title":"","content":"I'm a bit confused on how Prince Diamond is &quot;transgender&quot;. I love the character, but the appelation of him as transgender seems odd considering the cultural narratives of our world juxtaposed with the cultural narratives of exalted and foreign cultures outside our Western sensibilities.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T07:55:47-07:00","id":734761,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734711#post734711\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm a bit confused on how Prince Diamond is &quot;transgender&quot;. I love the character, but the appelation of him as transgender seems odd considering the cultural narratives of our world juxtaposed with the cultural narratives of exalted and foreign cultures outside our Western sensibilities.</div> </div> </div> </div>You might notice that the Delzhan is one of these places were its &quot;foreign culture outside our Western sensibilities&quot; does, in fact, coincide in part with our own in one respect, that being that the Dereth are a thing.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T07:59:07-07:00","id":734765,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>DrLoveMonkey</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734241#post734241\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I wonder if jiara is kind of the wig circles default place.</div> </div> </div> </div>What's a WIG circle? Is that what Plague keeps under his hats? <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/tongue.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Stick Out Tongue\" smilieid=\"5\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Also, cool bio. Like how it gives the Delzahn a more nuanced culture, and less dependence on whoever that Lunar is. Also the built-in cultural reason to go &quot;adventuring&quot;. And hmm, when the horse dies the reaction is so extreme you'd think they were raising a monument. Whereas Muad'dib either vanishes into the desert or goes on to glory &amp; national holiday; either way no monument for you <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> Transgender <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Now to brainstorm some ideas for 'what could be heroic enough to absolve this'.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2678-spoonr","name":"SpoonR","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2678_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"152"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:04:40-07:00","id":734770,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734761#post734761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You might notice that the Delzhan is one of these places were its &quot;foreign culture outside our Western sensibilities&quot; does, in fact, coincide in part with our own in one respect, that being that the Dereth are a thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>Yes, but the Dereth are completley social accepted without any consequence or complication, and they are based on gender roles rather then gender identity. So it's nothing like our worlds transgendered people.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:08:05-07:00","id":734776,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734770#post734770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Yes, but the Dereth are completley social accepted without any consequence or complication, and they are based on gender roles rather then gender identity. So it's nothing like our worlds transgendered people.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'm not sure exactly what point you're getting at?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:10:16-07:00","id":734803,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734776#post734776\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm not sure exactly what point you're getting at?</div> </div> </div> </div>The label &quot;transgender&quot; doesn't seem to fit the Dereth. Some Dereth may actually be transgender, but for most of them it's a social compact.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:10:32-07:00","id":734807,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734770#post734770\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Yes, but the Dereth are completley social accepted without any consequence or complication, and they are based on gender roles rather then gender identity. So it's nothing like our worlds transgendered people.</div> </div> </div> </div>It seems odd to suggest that not being socially accepted is an <i>inherent </i>part of being transgender.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:13:52-07:00","id":734815,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734803#post734803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> The label &quot;transgender&quot; doesn't seem to fit the Dereth. Some Dereth may actually be transgender, but for most of them it's a social compact.</div> </div> </div> </div>You are correct. Prince Diamond, however, is a transgender person who <i>also is</i> a Dereth. Those exist alongside &quot;I'm a gay woman and being a Dereth allows me to marry a woman&quot; Dereth, &quot;I would rather perform the gender roles expected of a woman than those of a man&quot; Dereth, and other reasons people took the grey sash.<br /> <br /> But Prince Diamond, like others, is a transgender person who took the grey sash because it allowed him to express his gender identity.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/85618-omicron-writes-stuff-hub-thread\" target=\"_blank\">Bits and pieces of Exalted setting.</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":7}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/67-omicron","name":"Omicron","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar67_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1428"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:15:35-07:00","id":734819,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Cogliostro</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734803#post734803\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">The label &quot;transgender&quot; doesn't seem to fit the Dereth. Some Dereth may actually be transgender, but for most of them it's a social compact.</div> </div> </div> </div>&quot;Gender&quot; <i>is</i> social! &quot;The cultural and social associations of masculinity and femininity, the state of being male or female&quot; is the very definition of the word!<br /> <br /> (As opposed to the state of your wobbly bits, which is your sex. Prince Diamond is transgender, but I doubt the physical state of his sex has changed.)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>He/him","edited":{"userid":177,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","user":"TheCountAlucard","date":". 10-28-2015, 11:19 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/177-thecountalucard","name":"TheCountAlucard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar177_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10857"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:16:43-07:00","id":734821,"title":"","content":"Previous comments have said that there are many reasons to become Dereth, like being a woman who wants to fight/man who doesn't. However:<br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stephenls</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Prince Diamond is a dereth guy who we here on Earth in the present would call an FtM transsexual man, mistakenly assigned the female gender at birth</div> </div> </div> </div>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>&quot;For me, there's no fundamental conflict between really loving something and also seeing it as very profoundly flawed.&quot; -- Jay Eddidin","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2168-chejop-kejak","name":"Chejop Kejak","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2168_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1219"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:19:09-07:00","id":734824,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734815#post734815\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You are correct. Prince Diamond, however, is a transgender person who <i>also is</i> a Dereth. Those exist alongside &quot;I'm a gay woman and being a Dereth allows me to marry a woman&quot; Dereth, &quot;I would rather perform the gender roles expected of a woman than those of a man&quot; Dereth, and other reasons people took the grey sash.<br /> <br /> But Prince Diamond, like others, is a transgender person who took the grey sash because it allowed him to express his gender identity.</div> </div> </div> </div>That's what I may have missed, I have read the descripton as Prince Diamond being transgender <i>because</i> he is Dereth, which didn't sit well with me.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/8760-cogliostro","name":"Cogliostro","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar8760_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"505"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:20:26-07:00","id":734826,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Omicron</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734761#post734761\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">You might notice that the Delzhan is one of these places were its &quot;foreign culture outside our Western sensibilities&quot; does, in fact, coincide in part with our own in one respect, that being that the Dereth are a thing.</div> </div> </div> </div>To be fair, many non-western cultures that do things westerners would find shocking, are cool with transgendered people (though generally in ways that are a bit different to western culture). Two-spirit shamans, etc. In certain parts of Pakistan being a tax collector was a traditional job for transgendered people (because when they turn up at tax evaders houses, the tax evaders are extremely embarrassed, and pay their taxes quickly).<br /> Hey, in Iran, being gay is a crime but being transsexual is not. Which leads to the weird situation where a gay man, not understanding what's going on, goes to the doctor and says &quot;I'm attracted to men, something must be wrong with me!&quot; And the doctor says &quot;Oh, don't worry, you're just a woman. These feelings are perfectly natural for a woman. You need gender reassignment surgery.&quot;<br /> Which I guess is similar to the Delzahn.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 10-28-2015, 11:22 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T08:35:45-07:00","id":734840,"title":"","content":"Different cultures put the divisions between labels in different places; we're actually pretty careful in constructing fictional cultures in Creation (or, I have been, anyway) to <i>not</i> write any culture that has gender politics that obviously corresponds exactly to liberal Western 21st century sex/gender ideas. At the same time, we're also very careful not to construct cultures that work like imagined 1950 heteronormative conservative Western ideas about sex/gender. So, gender-nonconforming people exist and their experiences are legitimate; people with gay and/or nonbinary sexual attraction exist and their experiences are legitimate, and the cultures of Creation generally have ways to acknowledge those things, but none of their labels correspond exactly to ours.<br /> <br /> Dereth is a label that's hugely useful for someone like Prince Diamond, but it could also be really stifling for someone who's nonbinary in a way Prince Diamond isn't.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":229,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","user":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","date":". 10-28-2015, 11:41 AM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":13}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/229-stephen-lea-sheppard","name":"Stephen Lea Sheppard","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar229_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1441"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T09:11:39-07:00","id":734934,"title":"","content":"Indeed, a bisexual would find it awkward, as would a woman who wanted to fight, but marry a (male) soldier. Or another female soldier for that matter.<br /> <br /> I like the way that sexual mores and even definitions in Exalted vary and don't quite fit with modern (western) ideas, because the historical study of gender and sexuality indicates that few societies in the past thought about it the way westerners do. The Romans being a very obvious example, the Vikings a less obvious one (although their's was a little similar to the Realm; being gay is fine, being <i>ergi </i>or weak/womanly is not).<br /> As do many societies today: where I live in China, it's maybe based on some similar concepts (&quot;unnaturalness&quot;), but obviously the huge amount of open homophobia I come across isn't based on religion.<br /> <br /> I want Exalted to be more tolerant than real-life history, so people have more freedom with their characters, but if it was a 100% tolerant, enlightened utopia, what would the PCs challenge?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":2402,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","user":"The Wizard of Oz","date":". 10-28-2015, 12:16 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T09:23:06-07:00","id":735013,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=734934#post734934\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I want Exalted to be more tolerant than real-life history, so people have more freedom with their characters, but if it was a 100% tolerant, enlightened utopia, what would the PCs challenge?</div> </div> </div> </div>Indeed, it would be very dull if it was a 100% tolerant enlightened utopia.<br /> <br /> It's a good thing it is a hellish wasteland of predatory spirits and internecine war, straddled by a brutal and expansionist empire and shadowed by the threat of universal extinction or enslavement from a plethora of nightmarish otherworldly powers, or characters might have nothing to <i>do.</i>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Writer for Exalted.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2093-crumplepunch","name":"Crumplepunch","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2093_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T10:27:11-07:00","id":735142,"title":"","content":"I really like the idea of Deretg because at first it seems all accepting and wonderful, but then you realize it's really not THAT accepting and had a wonderful strangeness to it.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>SWTOR Referal: <a href=\"http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.swtor.com/r/JQ2nqy</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/414-gallus","name":"Gallus","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar414_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"886"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T10:37:09-07:00","id":735163,"title":"","content":"<span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">&quot;a murder of passion, a slaying which was done in self-defense&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm confused as to how something can be both of these.</span></span></span>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/957-wulfram","name":"Wulfram","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"41"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T19:13:31-07:00","id":736519,"title":"","content":"I'm hoping we see a culture or cultures with a third gender this edition.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Check out my expansion to the <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/185084-autochthonia-house-material\" target=\"_blank\">Realm of Brass and Shadow</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1098-glamourweaver","name":"glamourweaver","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1098_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"7541"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2015-10-28T19:28:25-07:00","id":736541,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Wulfram</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/solar-exalted/734191-hatewheel-talks-the-3e-solar-sigs?p=735163#post735163\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"color:#141823\"><span style=\"font-family:Georgia\"><span style=\"font-size:17px\">&quot;a murder of passion, a slaying which was done in self-defense&quot;<br /> <br /> I'm confused as to how something can be both of these.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>The passion could easily have been &quot;OH SOL OH SOL I DON'T WANNA DIE STAB FOR MY LIFE-oops.&quot;<br /> <br /> Either that, or he went briefly berserk from fear-not difficult to imagine-and didn't realize his attacking wasn't moving until long after they couldn't move ever.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}